/target/
*.rs.bk

# compiled fixture binaries (rustc writes crate-named output to the
# CWD when fixtures are compiled without --out-dir). Root whitelist:
# the repository's real content is the four entries below — anything
# else at the top level (stray fixture executables, whatever rustc
# emits next) is ignored. Fixtures also compile to target/fixture-out
# in CI, so the strays should not appear at all.
/*
!/README.md
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/tests/
!/unsafe-scope-lint/
